  "topic": "Efficiency",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "questionText": "A can do a work in 12 days and B in 18 days. Working together, they finish in:",
  "questionTextHi": "A किसी कार्य को 12 दिन में और B, 18 दिन में करता है। दोनों मिलकर कार्य कितने दिन में पूरा करेंगे?",
  "image": null,
  "options": [
   {
    "id": "A",
    "text": "7.2 days"
   },
   {
    "id": "B",
    "text": "6.5 days"
   },
   {
    "id": "C",
    "text": "8 days"
   },
   {
    "id": "D",
    "text": "7.5 days"
   }
  ],
  "correctAnswer": "A",
  "explanation": "LCM 36 units. A = 3/day, B = 2/day → together 5/day → 36/5 = 7.2 days.",
  "explanationHi": "LCM 36 इकाई। A = 3/दिन, B = 2/दिन → साथ 5/दिन → 36/5 = 7.2 दिन।",
  "source": "SSC CHSL Tier-I PYQ-style demo · Kineora",
  "year": "2023",
