  "correctAnswer": "A",
  "explanation": "Speed = 240/12 = 20 m/s = 20 × 18/5 = 72 km/h.",
  "explanationHi": "गति = 240/12 = 20 मी/से = 20 × 18/5 = 72 किमी/घंटा।",
